WEBVTT

00:01:57.836 --> 00:02:01.335
Almost 98% of Anarctica is covered by ice

00:02:01.335 --> 00:02:03.778
at least one mile in thickness.

00:02:03.778 --> 00:02:06.859
Conditions in Antarctica are some of the most extreme

00:02:06.859 --> 00:02:08.305
in the entire world.

00:02:08.305 --> 00:02:10.157
On average, it's the coldest,

00:02:10.157 --> 00:02:10.974
windiest,

00:02:10.974 --> 00:02:12.352
driest continent

00:02:12.352 --> 00:02:14.183
and has the highest average elevation

00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:15.725
of all the continents.

00:02:15.725 --> 00:02:18.689
You might think that it snows all the time at the Poles,

00:02:18.689 --> 00:02:20.526
but Antarctica is so dry,

00:02:20.526 --> 00:02:21.996
it's considered a desert

00:02:21.996 --> 00:02:23.111
with annual precipitation

00:02:23.111 --> 00:02:26.252
of only 200 millimeters along the coast

00:02:26.252 --> 00:02:27.614
and far less inland.

00:02:27.614 --> 00:02:29.164
The temperature in Antarctica

00:02:29.164 --> 00:02:32.564
has reached -89 degrees Celsius.